      "id": "b86fe9001348-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "If it possible to make a meaninful word the 4 th , 5 th , 6 th and 7 th letter of the word \"CAPTION\" which of the following will be the first letter of that word? If no such word can be formed give \"S\" as the answer.",
      "questionHtml": "If it possible to make a meaninful word the 4<sup>th</sup>, 5<sup>th</sup>, 6<sup>th</sup> and 7<sup>th</sup> letter of the word &quot;CAPTION&quot; which of the following will be the first letter of that word? If no such word can be formed give &quot;S&quot; as the answer.",
